## Finding and bounded BUILD path

The accepted five-minute current-source reproduction still fails AC-4's maximum-gap condition: 6,050 matched frames over 302.506666 seconds, 20.000523 fps mean cadence, 89.163715 ms maximum EOF gap, and 753 of 6,049 gaps above 60 ms. The read-only output-flush ABBA repeat showed no repeatable `-flush_packets 1` effect: pooled read intervals >60 ms were 228/1,198 default and 227/1,198 flush, while the flush maximum was higher (96.677 ms vs 90.374 ms); write-boundary counts were 228/1,198 in both arms, with a higher flush maximum (96.578 ms vs 90.280 ms). Do not add the flag to production.

The approved next diagnostic is one read-only 600-frame capture on `/dev/video60`, keeping default production argv, one FFmpeg thread, one filter thread, queue size 1, mode, and reader fixed. Trace per-thread FFmpeg `ioctl`, `futex`, `poll`/`ppoll`, `select`/`pselect6`, `epoll_wait`, and `read`/`readv`/`write`/`writev` timestamps/durations with `strace -f -ttt -T`, keep payload buffers raw-only, and record monotonic full-read completions plus per-thread schedstat runtime/runqueue deltas at frame boundaries. Align >60 ms read gaps with per-thread wait IDs/durations and scheduler deltas; treat runtime without a blocking syscall as suggestive, not proof of user-space CPU work. Strace and post-read `/proc` snapshots add observer cost. Save no frame payload, edit no source, and make no production argv change. Keep PTS as V4L2 SOE, not EOF, and preserve `timestampEof` at full raw-frame read completion.

## Open evidence limits

- The ABBA runs remain sequential and straced; they do not prove an exact internal wait cause. The `-flush_packets 1` change was not repeatable.
- The proposed syscall/schedstat trace has not been run; the trace itself and `/proc` sampling will affect timing.
- Exact DQBUF-to-output frame identity remains unproven because the ioctl trace lacked sequence fields.
- AC-4 remains failed on the accepted five-minute reproduction. AC-6 reconnect/sibling continuity and AC-8 four-camera soak/CPU headroom remain hardware deferrals. The minor FFmpeg child resource-limit finding remains open.

